Name: Ghoti.io Runtime-debug(BRANCH)
Description: The language runtime stack's debugger: one debug model of breakpoints, stepping and the state of a stop, and a Debug Adapter Protocol adapter over a transport the host binds.
Version: (VERSION)
URL: https://github.com/Ghoti-io/runtime-debug
Libs: -L(PC_LIB_DIR) -l(SUITE)-(PROJECT)(BRANCH) -pthread
CFlags: -I(PC_INCLUDE_DIR)
Requires: (REQUIRES)
